  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"776\" height=\"743\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/surah-yaseen-pdf.png\" alt=\"Surah Yasin pdf\" class=\"wp-image-5599\" style=\"width:340px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/surah-yaseen-pdf.png 776w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/surah-yaseen-pdf-300x287.png 300w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/surah-yaseen-pdf-768x735.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 776px) 100vw, 776px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.darularqam.co.za/doc/surah_yaseen.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">surah yaseen pdf Download pdf file</a></strong></pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">surah yaseen pdf</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We thank God Almighty who has enabled us to serve His Mighty Book, and we ask Him to accept it from us and place it in the balance of our good deeds. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are pleased to offer you asurah yaseen pdf, where you can now benefit from a high-quality copy in PDF format.</p>\n\n\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading\">In the name of God, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful. Praise be to God, Lord of the Worlds,</h6>\n\n\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> and may blessings and peace be upon our Master Muhammad and all his family and companions.</h6>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thank you for downloading surah yaseen pdf and God is the Granter of success</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://masjideraza.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/Yaseen-Sharif.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://quranvoice.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5405\" style=\"width:97px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://www.moha.gov.my/images/maklumat_bahagian/PQ/yassin/Yasin.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://quranvoice.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/unnamed.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5381\" style=\"width:92px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"><a href=\"https://quranvoice.org/%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%b5%d8%ad%d9%81-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%aa%d8%b1%d8%ac%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a5%d9%86%d8%ac%d9%84%d9%8a%d8%b2%d9%8a%d8%a9-quran-recitations-with-translation-english/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">المصحف المترجم – الإنجليزية |Quran Recitations with Translation – English</a></pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">قوله تعالى:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.islamweb.net/ar/library/content/228/402/%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D9%8A%D8%B3#docu\">يس&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.islamweb.net/ar/library/content/228/402/%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D9%8A%D8%B3#docu\">والقرآن الحكيم</a></p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">887 - ك : أخرج&nbsp;أبو نعيم&nbsp;في الدلائل عن&nbsp;ابن عباس&nbsp;قال:&nbsp;كان رسول الله - صلى الله عليه وسلم - يقرأ في السجدة فيجهر بالقراءة حتى تأذى به ناس من&nbsp;قريش&nbsp;حتى قاموا ليأخذوه وإذا أيديهم مجموعة إلى أعناقهم وإذا بهم عمي لا يبصرون فجاءوا إلى النبي - صلى الله عليه وسلم - فقالوا ننشدك الله والرحم يا&nbsp;محمد&nbsp;فدعا حتى ذهب ذلك عنهم فنزلت&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.islamweb.net/ar/library/content/228/402/%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D9%8A%D8%B3#docu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">يس&nbsp;والقرآن الحكيم&nbsp;</a>إلى قوله&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.islamweb.net/ar/library/content/228/402/%D8%B3%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D9%8A%D8%B3#docu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">أم لم تنذرهم لا يؤمنون&nbsp;</a>قال فلم يؤمن من ذلك النفر أحد</pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">God Almighty says: Yes, by the Wise Qur’an</p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">887 - K: Abu Nu’aym narrated in Al-Dala’il on the authority of Ibn Abbas, who said: The Messenger of God - may God’s prayers and peace be upon him - was reciting during the prostration and reciting aloud until some of the Quraysh hurt him until they rose to take him, and their hands were gathered to their necks, and they were blind and could not see, so they came to the Prophet. - May God bless him and grant him peace - They said, “We call upon you by God and the Most Merciful, O Muhammad.” So he prayed until that went away from them, then Yasin and the Wise Qur’an were revealed to his saying, “Have you not warned them, they will not believe?” He said, and not one of that group believed.</pre>\n",
